  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: [{(102 + 42) - (4 × 3)} ÷ (2 - 4)] × 3 = 36\n\nSo, after interchanging the signs,\n\nOption 1) ÷, +\n\n[{(102 + 42) - (4 × 3)} ÷ (2 - 4)] × 3 = 36 ⇒ [{(102 ÷ 42) - (4 × 3)} + (2 - 4)] × 3 = 36\n\n[{__**(102 **____**÷**____** 42)**__ - __**(4 **____**×**____** 3)**__} + __**(2 - 4)**__] × 3 = 36\n\n[__**{2.42**____** - 12**____**}**__ - 2] × 3 = 36\n\n[__{2.42____ - 12____}__ - 2] × 3 = 36\n\n__**[**__**__-9.57__**__** - 2**____**]**__ × 3 = 36\n\n__**-11.57 × 3**__ = 36\n\n-34.71 ≠ 36 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) -, +\n\n[{(102 + 42) - (4 × 3)} ÷ (2 - 4)] × 3 = 36 ⇒ [{(102 - 42) + (4 × 3)} ÷ (2 + 4)] × 3 = 36\n\n[{__**(102 - 42)**__ + __**(4 **____**×**____** 3)**__} ÷ __**(2 + 4)**__] × 3 = 36\n\n[__**{60 + 12**____**}**__ ÷ 6] × 3 = 36\n\n__**[**__**__72__**__** ÷ **____**6]**__ × 3 = 36\n\n__**12 × 3**__ = 36\n\n**36 = 36 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 3) +, ×\n\n[{(102 + 42) - (4 × 3)} ÷ (2 - 4)] × 3 = 36 ⇒ [{(102 × 42) - (4 + 3)} ÷ (2 - 4)] + 3 = 36\n\n[{__**(102 × 42)**__ - __**(4 +**____** 3)**__} ÷ __**(2 - 4)**__] + 3 = 36\n\n[__**{4284 - 7**____**}**__ ÷ (-2)] + 3 = 36\n\n[__4277__ __**÷ **____**(-2)**__] + 3 = 36\n\n__**-2138.5 + 3**__ = 36\n\n-2135.5 ≠ 36 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) ÷, × \n\n[{(102 + 42) - (4 × 3)} ÷ (2 - 4)] × 3 = 36 ⇒ [{(102 + 42) - (4 ÷ 3)} × (2 - 4)] ÷ 3 = 36\n\n[{__**(102 + 42)**__ - __**(4 ÷ 3)**__} × __**(2 - 4)**__] ÷ 3 = 36\n\n[__**{144 - 1.33}**__ × (-2)] ÷ 3 = 36\n\n__**[142.67 × (-2)]**__ ÷ 3 = 36\n\n__**-285.34 **____**÷ 3**__ = 36\n\n-95.11 ≠ 36 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
